{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And HaShem</b> — and the glory of HaShem will appear over Judah and Ephraim." "<b>And the meaning of \"like lightning His arrow\"</b> — because He mentioned: \"I filled Ephraim's bow.\"" "<b>And the meaning of \"with a shofar\"</b> — that this will be heard, that He will gather Israel to the Hasmoneans:" "<b>In the storms of Teman</b> — a south wind." "<b>And HaShem over them</b> — over the Hasmoneans."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:32.476803124Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}